if ARCH_UMS9117

config MACH_NOKIA_TA1618
	bool "Nokia 3210 4G TA-1618"
	select FB_IOMEM_HELPERS if FB
	select MFD_SYSCON
	help
	  Board support for the Nokia 3210 4G (TA-1618), a UMS9117/T117
	  feature phone with 64 MiB of DRAM, a 240x320 panel and a matrix
	  keypad. The target is RAM-only: kernel, DTB and initramfs are
	  staged over the BootROM/FDL USB download path and nothing is
	  written to flash. The top 2 MiB of DRAM stay reserved for the
	  DTB, the bootstrap handoff record and the display buffer, and a
	  read-only diagnostics reader republishes the handoff record.

endif
